<title>GERMANY: Japan FinMin says to ask G7 to stabilise FX market.</title>
<headline>Japan FinMin says to ask G7 to stabilise FX market.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said on Friday that Japan would urge Group of Seven countries to stabilise the foreign exchange market at a meeting of top financial officials on Saturday in Berlin.</p>
<p>Arriving at Berlin airport on Friday evening, he said: &quot;Japan will ask G7 countries to stabilise the forex market.&quot;</p>
<p>--Berlin Newsroom, +49 30 203 981o</p>
